            "body": "> lua code setting `background` during `VIMINIT` stored a `last_set_sid` of -8, which causes [`bg_user_set`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/6a6431cb99f411a85ffb3157023cd4726614485d/runtime/lua/vim/_core/defaults.lua#L840C18-L840C29) to erroneously return `false`.\n\nhmm, it should be `SID_ENV` for VIMINIT: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/6a6431cb99f411a85ffb3157023cd4726614485d/src/nvim/main.c#L2095\n\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/6a6431cb99f411a85ffb3157023cd4726614485d/src/nvim/globals.h#L288\n\nmaybe we need `SID_ENV_LUA` ",
